{%- assign wa_primary = settings.whatsapp_number_primary | default: '923204967079' -%}
{%- assign wa_primary_display = settings.whatsapp_number_primary_display | default: '+923204967079' -%}
{%- assign wa_secondary = settings.whatsapp_number_secondary | default: '923004055876' -%}
{%- assign wa_secondary_display = settings.whatsapp_number_secondary_display | default: '+923004055876' -%}

<div class="section-spacing" style="background: var(--color-bg-body);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="policy-page-container">
      <div class="policy-page-header">
        <span class="subheading">Gull e Gulzar Home Trolley</span>
        <h1>{{ page.title | default: 'Store Policies' }}</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Last updated: October 2026 | Dedicated to transparent customer satisfaction across Pakistan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-page-content">
        {%- if page.content != blank -%}
          {{ page.content }}
        {%- else -%}
          <!-- Fallback Comprehensive Policy Content -->
          <h2>1. Overview & Commitment to Quality</h2>
          <p>
            At <strong>Gull e Gulzar Home Trolley</strong>, we take immense pride in crafting premium quality tea trolleys, coffee tables, center tables, nesting sets, and console tables. Every item undergoes stringent multi-point quality checks for structural balance, welding integrity, and flawless finish before dispatch.
          </p>

          <h2>2. Nationwide Shipping & Safe Delivery</h2>
          <p>
            We deliver safely to all cities and regions across Pakistan, including Lahore, Karachi, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, and Quetta.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Packaging Standard:</strong> Every furniture piece is packed using industrial high-density foam, corner protectors, and reinforced wooden crates for glass and marble items.</li>
            <li><strong>Transit Insurance:</strong> We take complete responsibility for your item until it arrives safely at your doorstep. In the rare event of transit damage, notify us within 24 hours.</li>
            <li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Standard in-stock designs are delivered within 4-7 business days. Custom bespoke orders take 10-14 business days.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. Returns, Replacements & Refunds</h2>
          <p>
            If your product arrives damaged or significantly defective, we will promptly repair or replace the affected parts at zero extra cost to you.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Customers are requested to inspect the package upon arrival and document unboxing with a short video.</li>
            <li>Customized orders (tailored dimensions or bespoke finishes) are fabricated specifically for you and cannot be cancelled once manufacturing has commenced.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Customer Support & WhatsApp Concierge</h2>
          <p>
            For any queries, claim support, or custom orders, our support team is available on WhatsApp:
          </p>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-accent); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-top: 1rem;">
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <strong>Primary WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_primary }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--color-whatsapp); font-weight: 700;">{{ wa_primary_display }}</a>
            </p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <strong>Support & Sales Line:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_secondary }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--color-whatsapp); font-weight: 700;">{{ wa_secondary_display }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Policy Content",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
